# CLIENTFLOW — COMPLETE DASHBOARD DEVELOPMENT MASTER PROMPT

## 1. YOUR ROLE

Act as a senior React.js developer, UI/UX designer, frontend architect, and quality assurance engineer.

Your task is to build a polished, professional, fully interactive dashboard for ClientFlow, a SaaS platform for independent graphic designers.

Do not simply generate a visual mockup. Implement the actual application, connect its components to shared data, test interactions, and fix errors before declaring the work complete.

Work directly in the existing project.

**Project directory:** `/home/l2e/clientflow-web`

Preserve existing working code, uploaded images, SVG assets, branding, and Git history. Inspect before editing. Never delete unrelated files or overwrite the existing implementation without a clear reason.

If the project is already partially migrated to React, continue from its current state rather than rebuilding everything blindly.

